{"id":"b06b2873482f11f7","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-dnc2-special-class.md","title":"二值 DNC 的非空特殊有效闭类","display":"thm-dnc2-special-class — 二值 DNC 的非空特殊有效闭类","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-dnc2-special-class","aliases":["20-thm-dnc2-special-class"],"display":"thm-dnc2-special-class — 二值 DNC 的非空特殊有效闭类","chapter":"10","section":"10.3","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Definition 10.3.1；Exercise 5.4.14","source_printed_pages":[121,185],"source_pdf_pages":[156,217],"depends_on":["[[20-df-dnc]]","[[20-df-stages]]","[[20-df-special-class]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-dnc2-special-class"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-dnc2-special-class</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-dnc2-special-class — 二值 DNC 的非空特殊有效闭类"},{"key":"chapter","html":"10"},{"key":"section","html":"10.3"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 10.3.1；Exercise 5.4.14"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>121</span><span>185</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>156</span><span>217</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d92408f78f418e97\" href=\"?note=d92408f78f418e97\" title=\"20-df-dnc\">20-df-dnc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"17bb91b14aad762c\" href=\"?note=17bb91b14aad762c\" title=\"20-df-special-class\">20-df-special-class</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_{\\mathrm{DNC}_2}:=\\{f\\in2^\\omega:\\operatorname{DNC}_2(f)\\}\">\\(C_{\\mathrm{DNC}_2}:=\\{f\\in2^\\omega:\\operatorname{DNC}_2(f)\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d92408f78f418e97\" href=\"?note=d92408f78f418e97\" title=\"20-df-dnc\">20-df-dnc</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"17bb91b14aad762c\" href=\"?note=17bb91b14aad762c\" title=\"20-df-special-class\">20-df-special-class</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}dnc2-special-class}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Special}(C_{\\mathrm{DNC}_2}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}dnc2-special-class}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Special}(C_{\\mathrm{DNC}_2}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>每个输入最多被一个已停止的二值对角输出禁止一个值，另一值总可用，所以类非空。违反 DNC 由单个输入及有限停止阶段见证，因此补集有效开。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 可计算，取索引 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e=f\">\\(\\varphi_e=f\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(e)=\\varphi_e(e)\">\\(f(e)=\\varphi_e(e)\\)</span>，矛盾。可计算树取长度 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> 串，检查所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e&lt;s\">\\(e&lt;s\\)</span> 的阶段 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> 对角计算。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 10.3.1；Exercise 5.4.14；印刷页 121, 185；PDF 第 156, 217 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-dnc","status":"resolved","id":"d92408f78f418e97","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-dnc]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-stages","status":"resolved","id":"4ef1aee16db6b308","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-stages]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-special-class","status":"resolved","id":"17bb91b14aad762c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-special-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-dnc","status":"resolved","id":"d92408f78f418e97","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-dnc]]；see [[20-df-stages]]；see [[20-df-special-class]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-stages","status":"resolved","id":"4ef1aee16db6b308","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-dnc]]；see [[20-df-stages]]；see [[20-df-special-class]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-special-class","status":"resolved","id":"17bb91b14aad762c","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-dnc]]；see [[20-df-stages]]；see [[20-df-special-class]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"C_{\\mathrm{DNC}_2}:=\\{f\\in2^\\omega:\\operatorname{DNC}_2(f)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}dnc2-special-class}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Special}(C_{\\mathrm{DNC}_2}).","display":true},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"e","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi_e=f","display":false},{"tex":"f(e)=\\varphi_e(e)","display":false},{"tex":"s","display":false},{"tex":"e<s","display":false},{"tex":"s","display":false}],"bytes":1399,"backlinks":[{"id":"331efd41ed572f